{"title":"Fine Trousers","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Bandit, Bandit Footpad, Highwayman, Cutthroat</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"cutthroat\" title=\"Cutthroat - dropped it in 1 of 5 looted corpses (1/5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/03b73f3c83dc4e79a4d0.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Cutthroat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"footpad\" title=\"Bandit Footpad - dropped it in 1 of 8 looted corpses (1/8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/1eae4e803907596d0d60.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit Footpad</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"highwayman\" title=\"Highwayman - dropped it in 1 of 32 looted corpses (1/32)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/01bd8b56b2a034105292.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Highwayman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/32<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bandit\" title=\"Bandit - dropped it in 2 of 132 looted corpses (1/66)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d647be846757b58c574.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/66<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"fine-trousers\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/e55acc011886a033e0b5.svg\" alt=\"Fine Trousers\"></div><h3>Fine Trousers</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>4 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/22/2026, 7:20:00 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}